# Ubuntu Installation Error / Issue

## Problem

After creating and configuring the Ubuntu 26.04 Virtual Machine, I was unable to proceed with the Ubuntu installation.

When I started the VM and selected **Try or Install Ubuntu**, the system remained stuck on the Ubuntu loading screen.

The Ubuntu desktop/installation screen did not appear, and the VM became unresponsive.

---

## VM Configuration at the Time of the Issue

- **Operating System:** Ubuntu 26.04
- **RAM:** 2048 MB (2 GB)
- **CPU:** 2
- **Virtual Disk:** 20 GB
- **Video Memory:** 18 MB
- **Graphics Controller:** VMSVGA
- **Network:** NAT

---

## Error / Issue Observed

The VM displayed the Ubuntu loading screen but did not proceed to the Ubuntu desktop or installation screen.

The mouse and keyboard also became unresponsive during the attempt.

